        content: 'My Time at Portia is a simulation RPG game developed by Pathea Games and published by Team17 Digital. Released in 2019, the game whisks players away to the enchanting town of Portia, where they restore their father\'s neglected workshop to its former glory. Players fill their father\'s shoes as an aspiring builder, using their growing trade skills to make their workshop the best in town. My Time at Portia encompasses crafting, farming, mining, fishing, and exploration all set in a wonderful post-apocalyptic backdrop. Players gather resources to create items, upgrade their workshop, cultivate crops and raise livestock, all while interacting with a cast of charmingly unique Portians. Known for its vivid artisanal world, immersive gameplay, and compelling combination of various RPG elements, the game\'s unique draw is its deeply interactive, ever-evolving world that beautifully encapsulates the simple joy of building. My Time at Portia has won numerous accolades for its innovative crafting mechanics, engaging RPG elements, and relaxing gameplay. If you\'re a fan of immersive life simulation games like Stardew Valley or Animal Crossing, you\'ll be a fan of My Time at Portia.',
