        content: 'I Am Setsuna is a Japanese role-playing game developed by Tokyo RPG Factory and published by Square Enix. Released in 2016, players control Setsuna, a young woman chosen to be a sacrifice to appease malevolent spirits plaguing her village. The player and her group engage in turn-based combat, a battle system similar to that of Chrono Trigger, with a focus on strategy and a variety of tech skills. The game features an emotional narrative that\'s underscored by beautiful piano and snowy environments that contribute to a unique melancholic ambience. The title stands out because of its innovative “Setsuna system,” which enhances the player’s abilities during combat based on their performance and tactics. Players traverse enchanting yet harsh landscapes, engage in battles, solve puzzles, interact with characters, and unfold the poignant story hidden in the snowy world. I Am Setsuna has been celebrated for its classic JRPG gameplay mechanics, heartfelt story, and enchanting environments that capture the essence of sadness. If you\'re a fan of classic turn-based RPGs with a deep narrative like Final Fantasy VI or Chrono Trigger, you\'ll be a fan of I Am Setsuna.',
