        content: 'Goose Goose Duck is a social deception game developed and published by Gaggle Studios. Making its debut in 2021, the game invites players into an exciting game of avian survival, playing as either geese working together to complete tasks or as a malicious mallard duck with destructive intentions. Aboard a spaceship or within a vast jungle environment, up to 16 players can participate in a game, making it perfect for lively online parties. Gameplay predominantly focuses on communication, teamwork, and deception, with geese attempting to complete tasks while simultaneously trying to unmask the mischievous ducks. In contrast, the ducks work stealthily to sabotage the geese\'s efforts without revealing their identity. The game offers a variety of roles, each with unique skills, adding an additional layer of strategy. With its hilarious and engaging dynamics, Goose Goose Duck breaks the mold of traditional social games, bringing in a delightful twist on the \"hidden role\" multiplayer. If you enjoy thrilling social deception games like Among Us and Town of Salem, you\'ll be a fan of Goose Goose Duck.',
