        content: 'Super Mario 3D World is a popular platform game developed and published by Nintendo for the Wii U. Released in 2013, the game features a wonderful combination of 3D environments and 2D gameplay taken from the extensive Mario franchise. The beloved characters, such as Mario, Luigi, Princess Peach, and Toad, embark on a quest to save the Sprixie Princesses from the clutches of the dastardly Bowser. Super Mario 3D World is characterized by its cooperative multiplayer gameplay, allowing up to four players to control different characters and traverse through levels together. Each character possesses unique abilities, lending an exciting strategic aspect to the player\'s choice. The game employs an overworld map similar to that in Super Mario Bros. 3, and coins collected in the levels can be used to earn extra lives. Known for its bright and visually stunning world, exhilarating stages, and engaging multiplayer mode, Super Mario 3D World continues to capture the charm and innovation embedded in the Mario series. If you\'re a fan of platform games like Donkey Kong Country or Rayman Legends, you\'ll be a fan of Super Mario 3D World.',
