        content: 'Yoku\'s Island Express is a charming blend of platforming and pinball, developed by Villa Gorilla and published by Team17. In this vibrant game released in 2018, players take on the charming role of Yoku, the dung beetle postman, on his adventure across Mokumana Island. The game presents a unique pinball platforming play style, where players navigate the open-world setting by launching Yoku around a landscape filled with flippers, bumpers, and slides. While on your quest to revive the island deity, you will encounter a whimsical cast of characters, discover hidden secrets, and complete various puzzles using innovative pinball mechanics. The game\'s tropical, hand-painted visuals and quirky storyline endearingly set it apart in the realm of platformers. Yoku\'s Island Express has been praised for its ingenious combination of pinball and platforming elements, charming environment, and engaging quests. If you\'re a fan of unique exploratory games like Ori and the Blind Forest or innovative platformers like Rayman Legends, you\'ll be a fan of Yoku\'s Island Express.',
