        content: 'Layers of Fear is a first-person psychological horror game developed and published by Bloober Team. The setting is an eerie Victorian-era mansion that players navigate as a painter with a dark past, attempting to finish his magnum opus while haunted by chilling hallucinations and his own deteriorating sanity. Gameplay primarily involves exploration and puzzle-solving as players unravel a gripping narrative through discovered notes, eerie paintings, and shifting environments. What makes the game stand out is its heavy reliance on atmosphere and story over combat, focusing on a slow-burning, psychological approach to horror. It expertly uses its environment to build tension and fear, with rooms frequently changing when players aren\'t looking, creating a labyrinthine, unsettling mansion that always seems against you. Layers of Fear is known for its immersive gameplay, chilling atmospherics, and the depth of its storyline. It combines the artistic process and the horrific to deliver a unique narrative experience. If you\'re a fan of psychological horror games such as Amnesia: The Dark Descent or the narrative depth of games like Gone Home, you\'ll be a fan of Layers of Fear.',
