        content: 'Dragon Ball FighterZ is a 2.5D fighting game developed by Arc System Works and published by Bandai Namco Entertainment. Based on the Dragon Ball franchise, it was released in 2018 and allows players to step into the world of iconic characters such as Goku, Vegeta and Gohan. Following a narrative that echoes the TV show\'s story arcs, players are pit against each other in team battles of up to three characters. Combat showcases visually stunning, high-speed battles that Dragon Ball is notorious for, with the ability to perform famous moves such as the Kamehameha and Final Flash. The game\'s unique Tag/Assist mechanics allow for strategic character switching and coordinated attacks, shaping a complex and exciting fighting style. A standout feature in FighterZ is its online mode where you match against players worldwide, fostering a thriving competitive scene. The game has been applauded for its balanced roster of characters, vivid graphics faithfully replicating the anime\'s aesthetic, and its nuanced, accessible combat system. If you\'re a fan of fast-paced, strategic fighting games like Street Fighter V or Guilty Gear Xrd, you\'ll be a fan of Dragon Ball FighterZ.',
