        content: 'Dishonored: Death of the Outsider is an action-adventure stealth video game developed by Arkane Studios and published by Bethesda Softworks. Released in 2017 as a standalone expansion to the Dishonored series, players take on the role of the supernaturally gifted assassin, Billie Lurk, who embarks on a mission to kill the enigmatic figure known as the Outsider. Gameplay in Death of the Outsider emphasizes stealth, tactics, and creativity, as players navigate through the beautifully crafted, ethereal world of Karnaca using a variety of supernatural abilities, weapons, and tools to overcome obstacles and elude or eliminate enemies. The game offers different methods to complete missions, encouraging player choice and offering multiple outcomes. The narrative of Death of the Outsider brings closure to the expansive lore of the Dishonored series, bringing to light many secrets from the previous games. Praised for its innovative gameplay, rich world-building, and compelling narrative, Dishonored: Death of the Outsider offers an unforgettable experience to those who step into its shadowy world. If you\'re a fan of stealth action games like Thief or narrative-rich adventures like BioShock, you\'ll be a fan of Dishonored: Death of the Outsider.',
