        content: "Dragon Quest Builders 2 is an action role-playing sandbox game developed by Square Enix and Omega Force. On its release in 2018 in Japan and worldwide in 2019, players found themselves immersed in a block-building adventure where they stepped into the shoes of a nameless character known as the Builder. Tasked with rebuilding the world after the events of the original Dragon Quest II, the game boasts an open-world terraforming environment that merges traditional RPG elements with sandbox gameplay. Alongside block-building, players are thrust into combat with monsters, engage in farming activities, and befriend the inhabitants of the game\u2019s expansive universe. The game\u2019s storyline proffers quests that need solutions shaped from the creative imagination of players and emphasizes exploration as one of its main elements. The co-operative gameplay option, an enhancement from the previous installment, allows players to team up and build grandiose structures. Known for its rich and charming world filled with endearing characters, Dragon Quest Builders 2 has been praised for its engaging narrative and creative freedom, offering a vast landscape inhabited by iconic Dragon Quest monsters. If you're a fan of crafting and building games like Minecraft or Terraria with added RPG elements, you\u2019d be a fan of Dragon Quest Builders 2.",
