        content: "Zoo Tycoon is a series of business simulation video games developed by Blue Fang Games and published by Microsoft. The first installment was released in 2001, allowing players to build their own dream zoo, making all the managerial decisions that come with it. In Zoo Tycoon, players commence with an open tract of land and a limited amount of zoo-building resources. As a zoo tycoon, the aim is to construct an assortment of animal enclosures, visitor facilities, and decorative elements to attract guests and garner profits, so you can invest in expanding your zoo. The game\u2019s complexity arises from understanding and catering to the different needs of both your animals and customers, which can range from providing the right types of trees in an enclosure to installing adequate restroom facilities. With its real-time strategy gameplay, educational animal facts, and creative liberty, Zoo Tycoon has been celebrated for its fun and educational value, accessible gameplay, and its realistic depiction of a zoo's functioning. If you're a fan of simulation games like RollerCoaster Tycoon or SimCity, you'll be a fan of Zoo Tycoon.",
