        content: "Binary Domain is a science fiction, third-person shooter video game developed by Sega's Yakuza Studio and published by Sega. Released in 2022, the story is set in mid-21st century Tokyo where players assume control of Sergeant Dan Marshall, a member of an international task force known as the Rust Crew, sent to investigate a robotics corporation suspected of violating international robotics norms. Binary Domains core gameplay is shooting combat, supplemented with character interaction and squad-based strategies. One unique aspect of the game is its consequence system called the Consequence System, where the trust or camaraderie between NPCs and the player character gets affected by in-game communication and actions, with potential impacts on the storyline and gameplay. The game blends cutting-edge shooting and AI technology to create a thrilling action experience, filled with robotic enemies and enormous boss encounters. Blended with a rich narrative, immersive world, and deep squad dynamics, Binary Domain delivers a unique and intense gaming experience. If you're a fan of squad-based shooters like Gears of War or narrative-driven games like Deus Ex: Human Revolution, you'll be a fan of Binary Domain.",
