        content: "Cuphead is a run-and-gun platformer developed by Studio MDHR and released in 2017. Rooted in a striking 1930s cartoon aesthetic, Cuphead tells the story of two brothers, Cuphead and Mugman, who make a deal with the Devil after losing a rigged game at his casino. To save their souls, they must embark on a quest to collect the souls of others who made similar pacts. The gameplay combines challenging boss battles, fast-paced platforming, and optional side-scrolling levels as players traverse different colorful islands filled with unique enemies and hazards. With its hand-drawn animation, jazzy soundtrack, and unforgettable character designs, the game delivers a visually and audibly stunning experience. Cuphead's difficulty is one of its hallmarks, demanding precision, quick reflexes, and creative use of parries, dashes, and weapon combo upgrades to succeed. The inclusion of couch co-op allows a second player to join as Mugman, adding a cooperative twist to the chaos. Cuphead has been widely celebrated for its meticulous artistry, nostalgic charm, and intense gameplay. If you\u2019re a fan of hard-as-nails platformers like Hollow Knight or retro-inspired games like Shovel Knight, you\u2019ll be a fan of Cuphead.",
