        content: "Ready or Not is a tactical first-person shooter developed and published by Void Interactive, released in 2023. Set in a gritty, realistic modern world, players step into the boots of an elite SWAT officer tasked with handling high-stakes, dangerous situations such as rescuing hostages, defusing tense standoffs, and neutralizing hostile threats. The gameplay emphasizes strategic planning, teamwork, and methodical action over run-and-gun tactics, demanding players use tools like mirror cameras, tactical shields, and non-lethal equipment to approach each mission carefully. Players can issue commands to their AI-controlled team or work together in multiplayer to coordinate their approach, adapting to scenarios that evolve depending on their actions and decision-making. The game stands out for its commitment to realism, with detailed weapon mechanics, dynamic AI behaviors, and immersive environments that challenge players' wits and precision. Whether clearing a claustrophobic apartment or navigating a sprawling, chaotic complex, tension remains palpable throughout. Ready or Not has been praised for its authenticity, atmospheric design, and rewarding challenge, catering to fans of strategic shooters. If you're a fan of slow-paced, tactical experiences like SWAT 4 or Rainbow Six Siege, you'll be a fan of Ready or Not.",
