        content: "Custom Robo, released in 2004 for the Nintendo GameCube, is a unique action-adventure game with a strong emphasis on arena-based battles using customizable robots. Set in a futuristic world where people settle disputes by battling with miniature robots called \"Robos\" in virtual arenas, players step into the role of a new bounty hunter who mysteriously inherits his father's Custom Robo and uncovers a deep conspiracy threatening humanity. The gameplay revolves around gathering new parts and weapons to customize your Robo, allowing players to create their own playstyle for high-energy, fast-paced battles. These fights take place in dynamic, destructible arenas where strategy, reflexes, and the right customization make the difference between victory and defeat. Beyond combat, the game also features an engaging story mode, filled with quirky characters and narrative twists as players investigate the truth behind the secrets of the world. With its blend of strategic customization, gripping plot, and high-octane action, Custom Robo stands out as both a competitive and story-driven experience. If you're a fan of games like Armored Core or Virtual-On, you'll be a fan of Custom Robo.",
