        content: "Brotato is a fast-paced roguelike arena shooter developed by Blobfish, released in 2023. The game has players take control of a potato armed to the teeth, fending off relentless waves of enemies in chaotic, procedurally generated arenas. As the last surviving potato of a spaceship crash, players choose from a variety of character archetypes, each bringing unique stats and traits to the table, such as specialized attack bonuses or defensive quirks. Gameplay revolves around surviving increasingly intense enemy waves, upgrading the potato's arsenal, combining weapons, and utilizing varied items to enhance abilities. Players can wield up to six weapons simultaneously, ranging from guns and melee tools to bizarre and hilarious gadgets, all while managing resources strategically to maximize survival chances. Each run in Brotato is distinct, thanks to the randomized waves and the combination of upgrades and weapons chosen by the player. What sets Brotato apart is its quirky charm, frantic pacing, and ability to blend humor with challenging roguelike mechanics, offering a fresh take on the wave survival genre. If you're a fan of addictive roguelike games like Vampire Survivors or Enter the Gungeon, you'll be a fan of Brotato.",
