                content: "Kunitsu-Gami: Path of the Goddess is an action strategy game developed and published by Capcom, released in 2024. Set in a breathtaking world inspired by Japanese mythology and folklore, players are drawn into the role of Soh, a masked warrior tasked with purging evil spirits called the Seethe from corrupted villages. The goddess Yoshiro accompanies Soh, and protecting her as she performs ritual dances is essential to restoring balance. Gameplay in Kunitsu-Gami: Path of the Goddess uniquely blends elements of action combat, real-time strategy, and tower defense. By day, players manage villagers, assigning them roles such as fighters or archers, building defensive structures, and preparing for nightfall. When darkness arrives, relentless waves of Seethe attack, and players must directly engage in hack-and-slash combat, combining swift attacks, strategic placement of defendable units, and the special abilities of the goddess to repel the horde. Each village offers unique environmental challenges and innovative enemy designs rooted in traditional Japanese aesthetics, while the constantly shifting night-day cycle keeps the gameplay intense and requires adaptive strategies. With its vibrant art style, distinctive blend of tactical and action elements, and deep mythological storytelling, Kunitsu-Gami: Path of the Goddess stands out among genre hybrids. If you're a fan of games like Pikmin or Okami, you'll be a fan of Kunitsu-Gami: Path of the Goddess.",
